
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API as PayLink API
    participant Wallet
    participant Fraud as Fraud Checks
    participant Biller as ElectroCo
    participant Notification

    Customer->>API: Submit bill payment request
    API->>API: Verify customer and daily limit
    API->>Biller: Request bill inquiry
    Biller-->>API: Return bill amount
    API->>API: Calculate service fee and total
    API->>Fraud: Check payment risk

    alt Fraud check fails or funds insufficient
        Fraud-->>API: Reject payment
        API-->>Customer: Payment rejected
    else Checks pass
        Fraud-->>API: Approved
        API->>Wallet: Hold total amount
        Wallet-->>API: Funds held
        API->>Biller: Send payment request

        alt Biller confirms payment
            Biller-->>API: Payment confirmed
            API->>Wallet: Finalize held amount
            API->>Notification: Send receipt notification
            Notification-->>Customer: Payment receipt
            API-->>Customer: Payment completed
        else Biller refuses payment
            Biller-->>API: Payment refused
            API-->>Customer: Payment failed
        else Biller timeout
            Biller-->>API: No response before timeout
            API-->>Customer: Payment status unknown
        end
    end
